It has come to our attention that your Lloyds TSB account information needs to be updated as part of our continuing commitment to protect your account and to reduce the instance of fraud on our website. If you could please take 5-10 minutes out of your online experience and update your personal records you will not run into any future problems with the online service. However, failure to update your records will result in account suspension. Please update your records on or before July 14, 2006. To update your Lloyds TSB records click on the following link: https://online.lloydstsb.co.uk/logon.ibc, Thank you. Lloyds TSB Account Management Team. Accounts Management as outlined in our User Agreement, Lloyds TSB will periodically send you information about site changes and enhancements. Please do not reply to this e-mail. Mail sent to this address cannot be answered. For assistance, log in to your Loads TSB Internet Banking account and choose the ""Help"" link on any page.",d13,Social Media and Online Communities,"GENERAL SETTINGS
